OL,3,AParaguay's President Santiago Pena
OL,4,Aimpeached and arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FParaguay's President Santiago Pena has
OL,7,Fbeen impeached and placed under house
OL,8,Farrest after the collapse of a digital
OL,9,Fbank with links to his private business
OL,10,Finterests.
OL,12,FPena was arrested on Friday minutes
OL,13,Fafter lawmakers, including from his own
OL,14,Fparty, unanimously voted to remove him
OL,15,Ffrom office due to a widening crisis
OL,16,Ftriggered by the collapse of Ueno Bank
OL,17,Fearlier this week.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
